title: Hire Advisors
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs, shuffle_leadership
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: week_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/kmtshuffle.jpg
go-to: add_advisors

We can hire members of our party as advisors for our upper organizations. Doing so needs money.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, right_advisor, center_left_advisor, whampoa_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: main
tags: remove_advisor

@remove_tanyankai
title: Remove Tan Yankai
view-if: tanyankai_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: tanyankai_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Tan Yankai has been removed as an advisor.

@remove_sunyatsen
title: Remove Sun Yat-sen
view-if: false
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: sunyatsen_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Sun Yat-sen has been removed as an advisor.

@remove_sunfo
title: Remove Sun Fo
view-if: sunfo_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: sunfo_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1

