@add_tanyankai
title: Tan Yankai
subtitle: -2 funds - Tan Yankai is a statesman and organizer within the party. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions -  Clear the Agenda, Party Discipline, Emergency Fundraising ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/TanYankai.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: tanyankai_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 6
choose-if: funds >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds. 
on-arrival: tanyankai_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; funds -= 2
go-to: advisor_menu

Tan Yankai is now an advisor.

@add_sunyatsen
title: Sun Yat-sen
subtitle: -2 funds - Sun Yat-sen is the father of our party and our nation. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Party Mediation, National Revolutionary Army, International Relations ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/SunYat-sen.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: sunyatsen_advisor = 0 and sunyatsen_dead = 0 and n_advisors < 6
choose-if: funds >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds. 
on-arrival: sunyatsen_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; funds -= 2
go-to: advisor_menu

Sun Yat-sen is now an advisor.

